# Measurement captures are disposable local working data. Reports give final
# results and reproduction commands (docs/runbooks/verification.md). These patterns prevent
# accidental commits; captures are not routine attachments or upload tasks.
*-smaps-init.txt
*-smaps-cycle.txt
*-smaps-trim.txt
*-smaps-rollup-*.txt
*-maps-init.txt
*-maps-cycle.txt
*-maps-trim.txt
*-mallocinfo.xml
